Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:12.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助的左眼又开始浮现神秘画面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:17.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是哥哥以前看过的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:22.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人已经策划了两起犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:26.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,借助神秘的左眼 爱之助试图与哥哥对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:37.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第5集
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:43.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请开开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:46.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:55.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 这都是因为你没还钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我当时在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:47.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我这是在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.57,0:02:09.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一连串的绑架案……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:11.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,婚礼杀人案……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:15.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,演唱会骚乱……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:20.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来每一起案件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:25.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都在为下一起案件做铺垫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:29.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥的真正目的到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:33.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们学校那个保健老师叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:36.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像是……狭山瞳？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:40.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他怎么会知道老师的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:53.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没 我只是想确认一下你有没有事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:05.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你最近没遇到什么怪事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怪事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:09.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:13.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:16.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你认识这个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:21.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？那个……认识
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:25.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,昨晚发现了他的尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:27.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,尸体？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:30.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,遗体被埋在新中川附近
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！叫刑警过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.78,0:03:53.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,遗体已经送去解剖室了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳女士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:05.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你涉嫌杀人 被依法逮捕 
请跟我们回署里一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:08.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？
- 向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:10.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是证据
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！请等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一定是弄错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:21.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师绝对不可能杀人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:22.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:05:01.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2月6日晚上9点30分 你在哪里做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:10.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2月6日晚上9点30分左右……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:15.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“我当时在做什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:24.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“怎么回事？我这是在哪儿？”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:31.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想不起来了……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的什么都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:39.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现场留下的足迹和你的鞋印完全一致
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们还找到了作为凶器的铁管
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:46.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有目击者看到你出现在案发现场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:48.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师绝对是清白的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:52.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我见见她吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:53.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行 快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你们了！让我见见她！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这不合规矩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:06:01.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个男生想见嫌疑人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我来处理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:18.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的想不起来……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:23.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么救那个老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:26.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就那么担心她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:33.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所有证据都指向她 既有动机 又没有不在场证明
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:36.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你什么都帮不上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:39.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:43.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我绝不会坐视不管的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:47.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一定会想办法把她救出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:56.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你就好好加油吧 弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:17.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么 狭山老师 我们继续吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:21.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在你把一切交代清楚之前 是回不去的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:30.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我再问一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:35.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2月6日晚上9点30分 你在哪里做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:37.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部的遗体不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:53.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前明明就放在3号冷藏柜里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不会有错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先搜查整个警署！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:07.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:14.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,关于高利贷放贷人被杀一案的调查报告
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:14.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:18.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嫌疑人狭山瞳背负着债务
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:21.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被害人谷田部负责向她催债
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:26.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有人目击过他在狭山家附近和工作单位蹲守堵人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:28.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嫌疑人还是什么都不肯交代吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:29.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:32.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她坚称自己什么都不知道 什么都想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:36.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不像是在说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:40.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,人受了打击有时确实会失忆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:42.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,继续盯紧她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:43.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下一项
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被害人的遗体怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:49.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们查了监控录像 但关键画面都被删了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:52.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,系统很可能是被黑客入侵了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:54.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道她有同伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:56.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再彻底调查一遍狭山瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 继续！
- 是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:06.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,断头台
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部的人寿保险单
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:15.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且受益人是他妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:22.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:26.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看样子一时半会儿是出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师绝不会做那种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:33.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也想相信她 但所有证据都对她不利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我赶时间 先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:42.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,实不相瞒 停尸房里谷田部的遗体不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:52.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部先生是不是有一份3000万日元的保险？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:53.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:58.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且领到钱的是他妻子？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:01.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是刑警告诉你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:02.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是又是你的直觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:09.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 明天我得去一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:15.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说不定能找到真正的凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:33.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你想跟我聊什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:40.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,遗体已经找到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:43.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,笔记本里连这事也写了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:49.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们打算把狭山瞳拘留到明天吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:54.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把她带到我这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:05.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是答应我的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:11.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就告诉你一些情报
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:20.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比如 那台电脑的主人有一个弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:28.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且那个男孩子 你也很熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:42.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你什么都帮不上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:43.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会把她救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:52.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:54.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们一直在等你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:56.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你看 很棒吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:00.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这张是给爱之助的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Lady X？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:04.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没听说过她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她现在可红了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:09.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,会表演断头台魔术呢 厉害吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:10.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,断头台？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这场魔术秀和案子有关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:21.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是以前跟我一起工作过的女人给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话说回来 房东 你以前到底是干什么的啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 不提也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:30.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然保密？太可疑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:47.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:51.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,过来陪我聊会儿嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:56.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,总是一个人待着无聊死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:13.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:32.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么写？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:39.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭窄的狭 高山的山 瞳孔的瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:41.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我叫黑晶晶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:46.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.98,0:13:51.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,*我想让你当我的卧底*
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.94,0:13:52.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么……？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:58.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,黑晶晶写作黑色的“黑” 水晶的“晶” “晶”也是水晶的“晶”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你做什么工作的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:16.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初中的保健老师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:19.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说是老师了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且还是公务员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,收入挺高吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:31.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,*报酬是2000万日元*
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,两千……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:15.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思让您翘班陪我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:18.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,肚子痛——
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:21.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从小学生时代起就百试百灵的借口
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:25.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没办法啊 班又不能平白无故不上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:30.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话说回来 遗体还没找到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还没呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:36.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我悄悄告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:42.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,停尸房的监控录像被删了 遗体多半是被人运走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底图什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.23,0:15:51.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:55.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小太郎 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:58.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:26.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:28.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:35.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问 那个洞是……？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:41.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是……我儿子淘气弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,淘气弄的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:48.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,昨天不是已经谈过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:52.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凶手不是已经抓到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:57.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有 我们还在调查
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冒昧问一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:07.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你丈夫遇害那天 你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:13.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那天我和儿子去看了魔术秀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:19.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从晚上七点一直看到十点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.26,0:17:26.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是Lady X的演出
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:30.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,魔术师应该还记得我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:34.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们去问问就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:43.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要想证明老师的清白 就必须找到真凶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:48.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我左眼看到的保险金 受益人是死者的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:52.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然我看到了 那就说明……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:15.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到她脖子上的瘀伤了吗？像是家暴留下的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,家暴？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:21.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,家庭暴力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:27.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,邻居们也听到过砸东西的声音和惨叫声
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:32.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说 如果谷田部的妻子长期遭受家暴……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就有了杀人动机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:42.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是啊 但她有不在场证明——当时在看魔术秀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:52.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在正要去那里 昨天正好拿到了门票
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗？那我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:57.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,亮出警徽就能进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:10.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:14.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能听到我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:20.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的什么都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:24.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能不能放我出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:36.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你们了 我真的想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:41.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,救救我 放我出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:52.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那种感觉……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:57.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我打了他……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:03.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我……是我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们想向您打听几件事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:49.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您对这两个人有印象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:52.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们2月6日来看过演出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:56.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我对他们印象很深
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:06.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为当时出了点小意外
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:11.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有个魔术需要从观众里挑志愿者配合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.85,0:21:41.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,数到一的时候 你就把拉炮拉响哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:47.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,3……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:49.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:50.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,1！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:09.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈不见了……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:14.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈……妈妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:21.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是妈妈不见了 我又会被打的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:23.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们完全没想到孩子会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.56,0:22:27.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,场面一下子变得很尴尬 我也慌了神
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.35,0:22:31.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“又会被打”……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:34.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来谷田部确实经常家暴他们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:37.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,后来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:40.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Lady X赶紧出来圆场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:46.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来 再拉一次拉炮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:49.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要 一拉妈妈就消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:51.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要再拉一次 妈妈就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:53.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:08.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.77,0:23:10.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小太郎……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:19.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那位母亲消失了多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:22.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为孩子一直在哭闹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.93,0:23:26.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,耽误了一点时间 不过平时也就两三分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么短的时间 根本不可能去杀人再埋尸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:34.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那在此之前或之后 她有离开过座位吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.04,0:23:38.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有 要是离席肯定很显眼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:43.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,观众也只能从大厅正门出入
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.35,0:23:49.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,演出还有10分钟就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:51.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:24:00.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,会不会是收买了保安 从后门溜出去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.03,0:24:04.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是从这里到埋尸现场 单程就要近一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:08.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算她中途出去过 时间也根本不够
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:12.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说 妻子不是凶手？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.31,0:24:16.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部家暴他们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.09,0:24:23.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀人动机很充分 但她的不在场证明毫无破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.95,0:24:42.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我……是我用铁管打了谷田部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他突然扑向我……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:55.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我当时太害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.21,0:24:58.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以就……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.58,0:25:23.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警官 狭山瞳全都招供了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.84,0:25:31.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:36.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:38.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.82,0:25:44.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们说狭山老师招供了 承认是她杀了谷田部……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:47.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.40,0:25:49.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.64,0:25:53.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师绝不可能杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:02.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一定是哥哥布下的圈套……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.48,0:26:05.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,必须赶快查出真相才行……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.63,0:26:19.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天 我要为大家展示一件在中世纪令人闻风丧胆的刑具
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.46,0:26:33.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然没错 这场魔术秀和案子有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:44.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我要惩罚这个犯下重罪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.97,0:27:09.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请大家屏住呼吸 见证罪人最后的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:15.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.48,0:27:29.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,落刀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:35.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,行刑完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.21,0:27:50.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这颗头颅就送给各位了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.01,0:27:54.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不对不对……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.87,0:27:57.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.19,0:27:59.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,卷心菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.30,0:28:34.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 接下来是压轴好戏
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.73,0:29:03.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天我特意改动了内容
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.85,0:29:06.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:17.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我把炸药放进箱子里 一旦爆炸 里面的人当然必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.96,0:29:29.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能成功吗？这需要极大的努力 希望能得到大家的支持……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.68,0:29:36.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有哪位勇士敢躺进箱子里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.48,0:29:41.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的一个都没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.07,0:29:57.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天场内就没有一个有胆量的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.41,0:30:00.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,随便哪位都行！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.36,0:30:05.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们都是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:07.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:12.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很有精神的回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.69,0:30:17.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请那位勇敢的少年上台来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:25.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.10,0:30:27.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会为你加油的！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.19,0:30:40.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请大家为这位勇敢的少年鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.13,0:31:01.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,逃脱方法写在左侧箱壁上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.04,0:31:10.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便问一句 你还记得我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.94,0:31:12.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么……？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:17.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们以前见过的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.59,0:32:29.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,点燃引信后 炸药将在10秒后爆炸 绝不可能逃脱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:48.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,8 7 6 5……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:12.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来我多放了5克炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.98,0:33:45.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.77,0:33:53.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.00,0:33:55.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部的尸体之前放在几号停尸柜？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.74,0:33:58.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,3号柜
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.80,0:34:08.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.00,0:34:15.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部？！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.05,0:34:19.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,魔术里用的也是同样的机关
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.88,0:34:23.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:43.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这不是谷田部……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.18,0:34:44.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:47.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.73,0:34:58.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.98,0:35:26.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你想破头也没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.59,0:35:31.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.01,0:35:33.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.14,0:35:37.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快叫福地警视来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.37,0:35:40.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又是你那能力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.13,0:35:45.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 我好像全弄明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.54,0:36:23.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谷田部洋二
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.40,0:36:37.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是按指示办事……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:42.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你不想重新开始人生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.91,0:36:43.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,重新开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.96,0:36:48.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的生意垮了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.55,0:36:54.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为压力过大 你甚至对妻儿动了手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:58.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的人生已经快完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.51,0:37:02.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.68,0:37:06.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,帮你重获新生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.16,0:37:10.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那……要我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.83,0:37:16.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去假装袭击一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.05,0:37:21.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没想到事情会变成这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.99,0:37:26.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那具尸体是谁的？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.36,0:37:29.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的不知道……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.02,0:37:31.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我收到的命令只是去袭击狭山老师
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:11.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.49,0:38:14.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到塑料布了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.65,0:38:17.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.81,0:38:20.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,掀开看看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.13,0:38:31.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.77,0:38:38.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,死人！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.88,0:38:43.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把尸体埋了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.29,0:38:48.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等 这不就成了共犯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.84,0:38:53.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不照做 我就告诉警察人是你杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:57.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在去挖坑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.71,0:39:01.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这样你就能重新开始人生了……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:06.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我根本没想到会被卷进这种罪案里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.42,0:39:17.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老公！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.28,0:39:22.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是为了给我们留下一笔钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.89,0:39:26.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我难道求过你这样做吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.61,0:39:29.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道就为了这个……？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.18,0:39:38.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.54,0:39:43.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.47,0:40:01.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果当时马上解剖 就会发现那是另一具尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.19,0:40:07.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以犯人才把它藏了起来……利用和魔术相同的机关
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.98,0:40:16.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说的对吧 向坂刑警？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.86,0:40:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？为什么问我？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.47,0:40:24.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得 向坂刑警肯定早就看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.17,0:40:29.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实没有 反倒是你的推理让我吃了一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.09,0:40:30.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗 加藤先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:33.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是啊 你真厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.47,0:40:44.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 我想和你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.54,0:40:48.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能跟我们回一趟警署吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:41:02.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.02,0:41:08.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我听说啦 是你证明了我的清白！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.08,0:41:12.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事了就好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.46,0:41:15.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.42,0:41:19.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我之前什么都想不起来……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.06,0:41:24.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好啦 我们回家吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.21,0:41:30.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.29,0:41:35.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有点事要和福地警视谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.45,0:41:48.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我认为谷田部和尸体失踪案没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.25,0:41:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一切说不定全是为了下一桩罪案准备的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.73,0:42:01.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.97,0:42:07.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.28,0:42:16.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直在注意你 你总是对案件了如指掌
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.15,0:42:20.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我并不觉得你和罪犯是一伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.15,0:42:28.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,甚至恰恰相反 你总是在想办法阻止犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.14,0:42:42.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有个叫黑晶晶的在押犯 跟我说了一件很有意思的事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.80,0:42:44.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.39,0:42:50.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她说你有一个在爆炸事故中死去的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.44,0:42:57.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他跟现在发生的这些事 是不是有什么关联？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.46,0:43:06.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在尸体身份被查清前 执行B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.85,0:43:08.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给他打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.79,0:43:12.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.39,0:43:24.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,突然打扰很不好意思 能请你帮个忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.84,0:43:28.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白了 我这就准备
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.76,0:43:31.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,准备什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.26,0:43:35.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚好接了个活儿
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.88,0:43:36.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接活儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.61,0:43:41.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好可疑！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.66,0:43:42.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,咦 换新洗发水了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.99,0:43:44.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯 那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.72,0:43:59.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:05.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么办？要不要说？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.30,0:44:07.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.71,0:44:12.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是哥哥说过 如果我告诉别人 他就会杀了那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.02,0:44:18.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不想让福地先生丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.74,0:44:21.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.97,0:44:27.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但光靠我一个人 根本阻止不了哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.32,0:44:34.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果能得到福地先生代表的警方的帮助 或许……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.31,0:44:51.08,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.30,0:44:57.67,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.70,0:45:02.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥……我哥哥他……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.76,0:45:05.66,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.76,0:45:13.59,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.69,0:45:20.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.64,0:45:26.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.21,0:45:34.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.43,0:45:34.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本剧主题曲《瞳之屏幕》由Hey! Say! JUMP演唱 将抽选赠送给100名观众
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.23,0:45:36.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请写明住址 姓名 年龄 以及对节目的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.72,0:45:44.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,寄给我们 就有机会获得
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:49.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.43,0:45:57.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
